OL,3,GNEWSA'Kids throw bricks at us': Carers
OL,4,Areport racist abuse at work
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the past year, staff have reported
OL,7,Fbeing racially abused, spat at and
OL,8,Fhaving objects thrown at them. One
OL,9,Fworker said a firework had been thrown
OL,10,Fat her, while another said he was
OL,11,Falways "looking over his shoulder"
OL,12,Fafter stones were thrown at him.
OL,14,FMerseyside Police said it had contacted
OL,15,Fthe charity to provide reassurance to
OL,16,Fstaff and gather any details that might
OL,17,Fhelp officers investigate the
OL,18,Fallegations.
